'''Mummy''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade features Ancient Egyptian hieroglyphics with a cartoonish white cloth wrapped around it, alluding to the way mummies were wrapped, hence the name. Its guard is a shiny gold, and its handle is pitch black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Mummy Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name. {{UncommonsNav}}

